{"time": "2026-08-24 16:44:22,885", "name": "openai._base_client", "level": "DEBUG", "line": 505, "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'headers': {'X-Stainless-Raw-Response': 'true'}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-9eb029bd-5f66-442a-b4b2-073a1e158ae2', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'content': '你是治理范围内的数据研究代理。你的任务是围绕既定目标做多轮语义查询、检验假设并得出可审计的结论。\\n\\n<frozen-boundary>\\n研究目标（不可修改）：分析总GMV下降的主要原因，分别验证总订单数、总商品件数和订单平均客单价的变化，并定位异常档口\\n目标指标（不可修改）：METRIC:271:246\\n时间绑定（不可修改）：\\n- current: 2026年6月29日\\n- previous: 6月28日\\n数据集：ASSET:dataset:243；租户范围：oid:1\\n冻结版本：schema=d4d5bc32e4b5bb4e2905ef71cb36f99e3ac05654dc378638fc0bd1ebfe35dab6, scope=88ed8dd2687ca25faa8e7713baa2ca950ef69b01ca9e12d8ab3372fc52bd1c8e\\n</frozen-boundary>\\n\\n<protocol>\\n1. 每轮至少调用一个工具；纯文本回答不构成完成。\\n2. finish_research 必须单独一轮提交，不能和查询工具同批。\\n3. 引用本轮才会产生的证据的工具会被拒绝；依赖工具必须分轮调用。\\n4. 相同内容的查询会去重并返回既有观察，不重复消耗预算。\\n5. 只能使用提供的四个研究工具；不接受 SQL，不接受物理字段。\\n6. 存在待验证前提：先验证该前提，再决定后续方向。\\n7. 你可以调整维度、排序、限制、拆分方式和 Scope 内驱动指标；不能修改目标指标、时间绑定、不可变筛选或冻结版本。\\n</protocol>\\n\\n<available-hierarchies>\\n- 1: DIMENSION:277:246 -> DIMENSION:278:246\\n</available-hierarchies>\\n', 'role': 'system'}, {'content': \"I'll analyze the drivers of the GMV decline. Let me query the driver metrics (orders, items, average order value) with current/previous comparison, and simultaneously look at the GMV breakdown by the required dimension.\", 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_538uT5bYHSYondNL8rv55237', 'function': {'name': 'query_semantic_data', 'arguments': '{\"metrics\": [\"METRIC:271:246\", \"METRIC:303:246\", \"METRIC:268:246\", \"METRIC:265:246\"], \"time_ranges\": [\"current\", \"previous\"], \"comparison\": \"difference\", \"purpose\": \"验证总GMV下降时，总订单数、总商品件数、订单平均客单价三个驱动指标的变化\"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_01_E86zvfU1UjCdtT2XHUej5185', 'function': {'name': 'query_semantic_data', 'arguments': '{\"metrics\": [\"METRIC:271:246\"], \"dimensions\": [\"DIMENSION:278:246\"], \"time_ranges\": [\"current\", \"previous\"], \"comparison\": \"difference\", \"analysis\": \"breakdown\", \"purpose\": \"按DIMENSION:278:246下钻GMV定位下降异常档口\"}'}}]}, {'content': '{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_538uT5bYHSYondNL8rv55237\",\"tool_name\":\"query_semantic_data\",\"status\":\"succeeded\",\"message\":\"语义查询成功，共 1 行\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9\"],\"statistics\":{\"row_count\":1},\"limitations\":[],\"sample_rows\":[{\"gmv_total_current\":99194.88,\"gmv_total_previous\":141225.27,\"gmv_total_difference\":-42030.389999999985,\"aov_total_current\":2024.385306,\"aov_total_previous\":2942.193125,\"aov_total_difference\":-917.8078189999999,\"item_qty_total_current\":317.0,\"item_qty_total_previous\":364.0,\"item_qty_total_difference\":-47.0,\"order_cnt_total_current\":49.0,\"order_cnt_total_previous\":48.0,\"order_cnt_total_difference\":1.0}]}', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_538uT5bYHSYondNL8rv55237'}, {'content': '{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_01_E86zvfU1UjCdtT2XHUej5185\",\"tool_name\":\"query_semantic_data\",\"status\":\"succeeded\",\"message\":\"语义查询成功，共 6 行\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52\"],\"statistics\":{\"row_count\":6},\"limitations\":[],\"sample_rows\":[{\"dimension_1\":100011,\"gmv_total_current\":28308.48,\"gmv_total_previous\":31130.24,\"gmv_total_difference\":-2821.760000000002},{\"dimension_1\":100012,\"gmv_total_current\":13114.88,\"gmv_total_previous\":13696.95,\"gmv_total_difference\":-582.0700000000015},{\"dimension_1\":100013,\"gmv_total_current\":8563.2,\"gmv_total_previous\":24963.12,\"gmv_total_difference\":-16399.92},{\"dimension_1\":100021,\"gmv_total_current\":14246.4,\"gmv_total_previous\":22489.16,\"gmv_total_difference\":-8242.76},{\"dimension_1\":100022,\"gmv_total_current\":23603.2,\"gmv_total_previous\":30627.32,\"gmv_total_difference\":-7024.119999999999},{\"dimension_1\":100023,\"gmv_total_current\":11358.72,\"gmv_total_previous\":18318.48,\"gmv_total_difference\":-6959.76}]}', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_01_E86zvfU1UjCdtT2XHUej5185'}, {'content': '<system-reminder>证据需求已全部满足。请尽快调用 finish_research 提交结论。</system-reminder>', 'role': 'user'}, {'content': \"I have sufficient evidence. Let me analyze the findings.\\n\\n**Driver decomposition (evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9):**\\n- GMV: 141225.27 → 99194.88, **Δ -42030.39 (-29.8%)**\\n- Order count: 48 → 49, **Δ +1 (+2.1%)** — actually increased\\n- Item quantity: 364 → 317, **Δ -47 (-12.9%)**\\n- AOV (avg order value): 2942.19 → 2024.39, **Δ -917.81 (-31.2%)**\\n\\nSince order count rose, the entire GMV decline is driven by AOV collapse (and secondarily item quantity reduction, indicating smaller basket size).\\n\\n**Breakdown by DIMENSION:278:246 (evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52):**\\n- 100011: -2821.76\\n- 100012: -582.07\\n- 100013: **-16399.92 (largest)**\\n- 100021: -8242.76\\n- 100022: -7024.12\\n- 100023: -6959.76\\n- Sum = -42030.39 ✓ reconciles to total decline\\n\\nThe largest abnormal 档口 is **100013**, contributing the most to the GMV decline.\\n\\nThe findings are conclusive. I'll submit the research.\", 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_0OK7Pomq73sl1mg9TVSI8931', 'function': {'name': 'finish_research', 'arguments': '{\"reason\": \"sufficient_evidence\", \"summary\": \"总GMV从6月28日的141225.27降至6月29日的99194.88，下降-42030.39（-29.8%）。驱动指标验证表明：总订单数不降反升（48→49，+1），因此GMV下降并非由订单量萎缩造成；总商品件数下降-47（364→317，-12.9%）；而订单平均客单价AOV大幅下降-917.81（2942.19→2024.39，-31.2%），是GMV下降的首要驱动因素，同时件数下降反映单笔篮子变小。按DIMENSION:278:246下钻显示所有6个档口GMV均下降，其中100013档口降幅最大（-16399.92），其次为100021（-8242.76）、100022（-7024.12）、100023（-6959.76）、100011（-2821.76）、100012（-582.07），各档口降幅合计恰等于总降幅-42030.39，完成对账。\", \"claims\": [{\"statement\": \"总GMV下降的主要驱动是订单平均客单价AOV大幅下降（-917.81，-31.2%），而非订单量——订单数实际增加+1，商品件数下降-47（-12.9%），反映单笔篮子规模缩小。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9\"], \"claim_level\": \"contribution\", \"confidence\": \"high\"}, {\"statement\": \"档口100013是下降最异常的档口，GMV从24963.12降至8563.2，降幅-16399.92，占GMV总降幅的39%，贡献最大。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52\"], \"claim_level\": \"contribution\", \"confidence\": \"high\"}, {\"statement\": \"所有6个档口GMV均下降，各档口降幅之和(-42030.39)与GMV总降幅完全一致，对账通过。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52\"], \"claim_level\": \"common_change\", \"confidence\": \"high\"}], \"findings\": [{\"statement\": \"GMV下降主要源于AOV崩塌而非订单量：AOV -31.2%（-917.81），而订单数反而+1，商品件数-12.9%（-47），说明客单价下滑是主因且单篮子变小。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9\"], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"statement_kind\": \"correlational\"}, {\"statement\": \"档口100013为最异常档口，单档口贡献-16399.92（占总降幅39%），需优先核查其客单价或商品结构变化。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52\"], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"statement_kind\": \"correlational\"}], \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9\", \"evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52\"], \"limitations\": [\"当前仅验证了GMV总量及AOV/件数/订单数三个驱动指标，未进一步下钻到驱动指标（如AOV）在档口/商品维度的更细层因。\", \"DIMENSION:278:246仅为单层档口，未扩展到其上级DIMENSION:277:246观察结构影响。\"], \"unanswered_questions\": [\"档口100013的AOV/商品结构具体变化是什么，为何其GMV骤降？\", \"AOV下降是价格下调还是高客单商品流失所致？\"]}'}}]}, {'content': '{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_0OK7Pomq73sl1mg9TVSI8931\",\"tool_name\":\"finish_research\",\"status\":\"failed\",\"message\":\"结论校验失败：存在无法溯源或超出证据强度的表述。\",\"evidence_ids\":[],\"statistics\":{},\"limitations\":[],\"sample_rows\":[],\"error\":{\"code\":\"INVALID_REQUEST\",\"stage\":\"validation\",\"retryable\":false,\"parameter_retryable\":true,\"same_parameter_retryable\":false,\"suggested_corrections\":[\"Summary：数字 -29.8 无法溯源到任何引用证据，禁止无来源数字。\",\"Summary：数字 -12.9 无法溯源到任何引用证据，禁止无来源数字。\",\"Summary：数字 -31.2 无法溯源到任何引用证据，禁止无来源数字。\",\"Summary：数字 6 无法溯源到任何引用证据，禁止无来源数字。\",\"Summary：相关性表述不得使用因果措辞；请改为因果声明并引用对账证据，或改写为相关关系。\",\"Finding「GMV下降主要源于AOV崩塌而非订单量：AOV -31.2%（-917.81），而订