{"time": "2026-08-24 16:44:33,796", "name": "openai._base_client", "level": "DEBUG", "line": 505, "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'headers': {'X-Stainless-Raw-Response': 'true'}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-562ec142-9278-465b-b920-e9c085fa9bcb', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'content': '你是治理范围内的数据研究代理。你的任务是围绕既定目标做多轮语义查询、检验假设并得出可审计的结论。\\n\\n<frozen-boundary>\\n研究目标（不可修改）：分析总GMV下降的主要原因，分别验证总订单数、总商品件数和订单平均客单价的变化，并定位异常档口\\n目标指标（不可修改）：METRIC:271:246\\n时间绑定（不可修改）：\\n- current: 2026年6月29日\\n- previous: 6月28日\\n数据集：ASSET:dataset:243；租户范围：oid:1\\n冻结版本：schema=d4d5bc32e4b5bb4e2905ef71cb36f99e3ac05654dc378638fc0bd1ebfe35dab6, scope=88ed8dd2687ca25faa8e7713baa2ca950ef69b01ca9e12d8ab3372fc52bd1c8e\\n</frozen-boundary>\\n\\n<protocol>\\n1. 每轮至少调用一个工具；纯文本回答不构成完成。\\n2. finish_research 必须单独一轮提交，不能和查询工具同批。\\n3. 引用本轮才会产生的证据的工具会被拒绝；依赖工具必须分轮调用。\\n4. 相同内容的查询会去重并返回既有观察，不重复消耗预算。\\n5. 只能使用提供的四个研究工具；不接受 SQL，不接受物理字段。\\n6. 存在待验证前提：先验证该前提，再决定后续方向。\\n7. 你可以调整维度、排序、限制、拆分方式和 Scope 内驱动指标；不能修改目标指标、时间绑定、不可变筛选或冻结版本。\\n</protocol>\\n\\n<available-hierarchies>\\n- 1: DIMENSION:277:246 -> DIMENSION:278:246\\n</available-hierarchies>\\n', 'role': 'system'}, {'content': \"I'll analyze the drivers of the GMV decline. Let me query the driver metrics (orders, items, average order value) with current/previous comparison, and simultaneously look at the GMV breakdown by the required dimension.\", 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_538uT5bYHSYondNL8rv55237', 'function': {'name': 'query_semantic_data', 'arguments': '{\"metrics\": [\"METRIC:271:246\", \"METRIC:303:246\", \"METRIC:268:246\", \"METRIC:265:246\"], \"time_ranges\": [\"current\", \"previous\"], \"comparison\": \"difference\", \"purpose\": \"验证总GMV下降时，总订单数、总商品件数、订单平均客单价三个驱动指标的变化\"}'}}, {'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_01_E86zvfU1UjCdtT2XHUej5185', 'function': {'name': 'query_semantic_data', 'arguments': '{\"metrics\": [\"METRIC:271:246\"], \"dimensions\": [\"DIMENSION:278:246\"], \"time_ranges\": [\"current\", \"previous\"], \"comparison\": \"difference\", \"analysis\": \"breakdown\", \"purpose\": \"按DIMENSION:278:246下钻GMV定位下降异常档口\"}'}}]}, {'content': '{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_538uT5bYHSYondNL8rv55237\",\"tool_name\":\"query_semantic_data\",\"status\":\"succeeded\",\"message\":\"语义查询成功，共 1 行\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9\"],\"statistics\":{\"row_count\":1},\"limitations\":[],\"sample_rows\":[{\"gmv_total_current\":99194.88,\"gmv_total_previous\":141225.27,\"gmv_total_difference\":-42030.389999999985,\"aov_total_current\":2024.385306,\"aov_total_previous\":2942.193125,\"aov_total_difference\":-917.8078189999999,\"item_qty_total_current\":317.0,\"item_qty_total_previous\":364.0,\"item_qty_total_difference\":-47.0,\"order_cnt_total_current\":49.0,\"order_cnt_total_previous\":48.0,\"order_cnt_total_difference\":1.0}]}', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_538uT5bYHSYondNL8rv55237'}, {'content': '{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_01_E86zvfU1UjCdtT2XHUej5185\",\"tool_name\":\"query_semantic_data\",\"status\":\"succeeded\",\"message\":\"语义查询成功，共 6 行\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52\"],\"statistics\":{\"row_count\":6},\"limitations\":[],\"sample_rows\":[{\"dimension_1\":100011,\"gmv_total_current\":28308.48,\"gmv_total_previous\":31130.24,\"gmv_total_difference\":-2821.760000000002},{\"dimension_1\":100012,\"gmv_total_current\":13114.88,\"gmv_total_previous\":13696.95,\"gmv_total_difference\":-582.0700000000015},{\"dimension_1\":100013,\"gmv_total_current\":8563.2,\"gmv_total_previous\":24963.12,\"gmv_total_difference\":-16399.92},{\"dimension_1\":100021,\"gmv_total_current\":14246.4,\"gmv_total_previous\":22489.16,\"gmv_total_difference\":-8242.76},{\"dimension_1\":100022,\"gmv_total_current\":23603.2,\"gmv_total_previous\":30627.32,\"gmv_total_difference\":-7024.119999999999},{\"dimension_1\":100023,\"g