compute-47ea571afd2ba51b）显示最异常档口为100013，贡献占比0.390（39.0%），降幅-16399.92；其余为100021占0.196、100022占0.167、100023占0.166、100011占0.067、100012占0.014。\", \"claims\": [{\"statement\": \"总GMV下降的主要驱动是订单平均客单价AOV下降-917.81与总商品件数下降-47，而总订单数反而+1，说明GMV下滑源于单笔篮子变小和客单价降低，而非订单量减少。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9\"], \"claim_level\": \"contribution\", \"confidence\": \"high\"}, {\"statement\": \"档口100013是下降最异常的档口，GMV差额-16399.92，对总降幅贡献占比0.390（39.0%），贡献最大，需优先核查。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-compute-47ea571afd2ba51b\", \"evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52\"], \"claim_level\": \"contribution\", \"confidence\": \"high\"}, {\"statement\": \"各档口GMV差额之和(-42030.39)与GMV总差额一致，贡献度计算的对账误差接近零，分解口径成立。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-compute-47ea571afd2ba51b\"], \"claim_level\": \"common_change\", \"confidence\": \"high\"}], \"findings\": [{\"statement\": \"GMV下降主要由AOV下降-917.81及商品件数下降-47驱动，订单数实际上升+1，表明单篮子客单价/件数收缩而非订单量减少。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9\"], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"statement_kind\": \"correlational\"}, {\"statement\": \"档口100013为最异常档口，贡献占比0.390（39.0%），单档口降幅-16399.92，远高于其他档口。\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-compute-47ea571afd2ba51b\"], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"statement_kind\": \"correlational\"}], \"evidence_ids\": [\"evidence:research-query-48820610e9d48ba9\", \"evidence:research-query-0238a294a72e9d52\", \"evidence:research-compute-47ea571afd2ba51b\"], \"limitations\": [\"当前仅验证了GMV总量及AOV/件数/订单数三个驱动指标的整体变化，未进一步下钻AOV在档口/商品维度的更细层因。\", \"DIMENSION:278:246仅为单层档口，未扩展到上级DIMENSION:277:246观察结构影响。\"], \"unanswered_questions\": [\"档口100013的AOV/商品结构具体变化是什么，为何其GMV骤降？\", \"AOV下降是价格下调还是高客单商品流失所致？\"]}'}}]}, {'content': '{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_Xyl9u8DTc2CERwIP8Rj07207\",\"tool_name\":\"finish_research\",\"status\":\"failed\",\"message\":\"结论校验失败：存在无法溯源或超出证据强度的表述。\",\"evidence_ids\":[],\"statistics\":{},\"limitations\":[],\"sample_rows\":[],\"error\":{\"code\":\"INVALID_REQUEST\",\"stage\":\"va