mmon_change 或 correlation_clue，并明确为共同变化或相关线索。\\n8. evidence ID 和资产 ref 只放在结构化引用字段中，不要写进 summary、finding 或 claim 的正文。\\n</protocol>\\n\\n<available-hierarchies>\\n- 1: DIMENSION:277:246 -> DIMENSION:278:246\\n</available-hierarchies>\\n\", 'role': 'user'}, {'content': '<agent-working-state>{\"research_agent_input\":{\"schema_version\":1,\"agent_input_ref\":\"agent_input_01\",\"user_question\":\"总GMV在2026年6月29日比6月28日明显下降了，帮我找出主要原因，需要的话可以量化各档口对这次下降的贡献。\",\"conversation_context\":[],\"semantic_context\":\"semantic_context:\\\\n  metrics:\\\\n  - ref: METRIC:271:246\\\\n    name: 总GMV\\\\n    description: 总GMV：基于字段 gmv_total 按模型粒度汇总。\\\\n    aggregation: SUM\\\\n    unit: null\\\\n    dimensions:\\\\n    - DIMENSION:278:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:277:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:306:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:305:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:276:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:304:249\\\\n  - ref: METRIC:266:246\\\\n    name: 销售商品件数\\\\n    description: 销售商品件数：基于字段 item_qty_sale 按模型粒度汇总。\\\\n    aggregation: SUM\\\\n    unit: null\\\\n    dimensions:\\\\n    - DIMENSION:278:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:277:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:306:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:305:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:276:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:304:249\\\\n  - ref: METRIC:303:246\\\\n    name: 订单平均客单价\\\\n    description: 订单平均客单价：按模型粒度计算，表达式为 ROUND(SUM(gmv_total) / NULLIF(SUM(order_cnt_total), 0), 2)。\\\\n    aggregation: SUM\\\\n    unit: null\\\\n    dimensions:\\\\n    - DIMENSION:278:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:277:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:306:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:305:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:276:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:304:249\\\\n  - ref: METRIC:265:246\\\\n    name: 总订单数\\\\n    description: 总订单数：基于字段 order_cnt_total 按模型粒度汇总。\\\\n    aggregation: SUM\\\\n    unit: null\\\\n    dimensions:\\\\n    - DIMENSION:278:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:277:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:306:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:305:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:276:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:304:249\\\\n  - ref: METRIC:268:246\\\\n    name: 总商品件数\\\\n    description: 总商品件数：