有 growth_rate/share/contribution 证据时，不得自行换算百分比。\\n7. claim_level=contribution 和因果措辞只能引用 contribution 或 reconciliation 证据；普通比较证据使用 common_change 或 correlation_clue，并明确为共同变化或相关线索。\\n8. evidence ID 和资产 ref 只放在结构化引用字段中，不要写进 summary、finding 或 claim 的正文。\\n</protocol>\\n\\n<available-hierarchies>\\n- 1: DIMENSION:277:246 -> DIMENSION:278:246\\n</available-hierarchies>\\n\", 'role': 'user'}, {'content': '<agent-working-state>{\"research_agent_input\":{\"schema_version\":1,\"agent_input_ref\":\"agent_input_01\",\"user_question\":\"2026年6月29日总GMV在各档口的分布情况如何？请先找出表现最异常的档口，再根据该档口的数据继续深入分析原因。\",\"conversation_context\":[],\"semantic_context\":\"semantic_context:\\\\n  metrics:\\\\n  - ref: METRIC:271:246\\\\n    name: 总GMV\\\\n    description: 总GMV：基于字段 gmv_total 按模型粒度汇总。\\\\n    aggregation: SUM\\\\n    unit: null\\\\n    dimensions:\\\\n    - DIMENSION:278:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:277:246\\\\n    - DIMENSION:306:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:305:249\\\\n    - DIMENSION:276:246\\\\n  dimensions:\\\\n  - ref: DIMENSION:278:246\\\\n    name: 档口ID\\\\n    description: \\'\\'\\\\n    grains: []\\\\n  - ref: DIMENSION:277:246\\\\n    name: 商家ID\\\\n    description: \\'\\'\\\\n    grains: []\\\\n  - ref: DIMENSION:306:249\\\\n    name: 档口ID\\\\n    description: \\'\\'\\\\n    grains: []\\\\n  - ref: DIMENSION:305:249\\\\n    name: 商家ID\\\\n    description: \\'\\'\\\\n    grains: []\\\\n  - ref: DIMENSION:276:246\\\\n    name: 统计日期\\\\n    description: \\'\\'\\\\n    grains: []\\\\n  hierarchies: []\\\\n  metric_formulas: []\\\\n  metric_analysis_relations: []\\\\n  ambiguities: []\\\\n\"},\"evidence\":[{\"schema_version\":1,\"evidence_id\":\"evidence:call_00_8RaxHtKDkxjuqZhSGdKI4678\",\"evidence_type\":\"query_result\",\"purpose\":\"执行 query_semantic_data\",\"definition\":{\"metrics\":[\"METRIC:271:246\"],\"dimensions\":[\"DIMENSION:278:246\"],\"time_ranges\":[{\"start\":\"2026-06-29\",\"end\":\"2026-06-29\",\"granularity\":\"day\"}],\"filters\":[],\"comparison\":null,\"computation\":null},